 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "hook",
   "text": "This is the biggest bathroom remodeling special we have ever run.",
   "t0": 0.0,
   "t1": 3.96
  },
  {
   "id": "b1",
   "text": "Our full bathroom remodels start at just $14,995.",
   "t0": 4.22,
   "t1": 8.04
  },
  {
   "id": "b2",
   "text": "That is the whole bathroom, start to finish.",
   "t0": 8.94,
   "t1": 11.26
  },
  {
   "id": "b3",
   "text": "We take the old one out, install a brand new walk in shower or bathtub, fully waterproof it, add modern wall surrounds in either tile or acrylic, and finish it with a new glass shower door, a new vanity, a new toilet, new flooring and all new fixtures.",
   "t0": 11.62,
   "t1": 25.2
  },
  {
   "id": "b4",
   "text": "But here is what actually makes the difference.",
   "t0": 25.6,
   "t1": 27.66
  },
  {
   "id": "b5",
   "text": "You are not dealing with individual plumbers, and then a tile guy, and then an electrician that you end up chasing around your own home.",
   "t0": 27.66,
   "t1": 34.24
  },
  {
   "id": "b6",
   "text": "You are dealing with one professional team, one point of contact, and one company that is responsible for the finished result.",
   "t0": 34.6,
   "t1": 40.96
  },
  {
   "id": "b7",
   "text": "And because we carry our own materials right here in our showroom, you are not paying a supplier's markup on top.",
   "t0": 41.18,
   "t1": 46.46
  },
  {
   "id": "b8",
   "text": "So you get quality materials at a fair price.",
   "t0": 46.62,
   "t1": 49.02
  },
  {
   "id": "b9",
   "text": "When we come out to your home, we listen to exactly what you need, we design your bathroom around that, and we hand you a detailed, itemized estimate before any work begins.",
   "t0": 49.3,
   "t1": 57.84
  },
  {
   "id": "b10",
   "text": "Then you come into our showroom and pick your materials in person.",
   "t0": 58.26,
   "t1": 61.16
  },
  {
   "id": "b11",
   "text": "Your work is backed by a two year labor warranty, plus the full manufacturer warranty on your materials.",
   "t0": 61.48,
   "t1": 66.76
  },
  {
   "id": "b12",
   "text": "At Luxury Home Renovations, we have 38 years of experience, and we are licensed in both Tennessee and Georgia.",
   "t0": 67.06,
   "t1": 73.02
  },
  {
   "id": "cta",
   "text": "Click \"Get Quote\" to book your free design consultation on our full bathroom remodels.",
   "t0": 73.22,
   "t1": 77.44
  }
 ]
